tions.\nChoice: PPO from scratch. It learns from every step, it isn't anchored to the pilot's habits (it never comes to rest off the pad, the pilot's main failure), and it was still improving: the average of its 200-flight checks went 90.8% (26 M steps) -> 93.8% (39 M). Its touchdowns are faster (median 0.25 vs 0.07 for the pilot) but they hold.\nWhere it fails: boulder hits, more often when the boulder floats 1-2.5 m off centre (10-12% failed) than near the middle (2-7%).\nMain run M1 continues A's network and optimiser: stage 1 more real-task training, stage 2 hard cases (30% re-flown failed check seeds), stage 3 fine-tune (lr 1e-4). Supervised; checks every 10 iterations on 200 fresh flights.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-30 21:32:57","kind":"goal_best","it":40,"steps":671744,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task, keep learning","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.955,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.025,"crashed":0.02,"score":259.6543086504571},"champion":"runs/M1/champions/i00040_s0_goal.json","run":"M1","replay":"replays/M1_0004.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 21:32:48","kind":"goal_best","it":30,"steps":507904,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task, keep learning","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.935,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.015,"boulder":0.045,"crashed":0.005,"score":250.71120553018307},"champion":"runs/M1/champions/i00030_s0_goal.json","run":"M1","replay":"replays/M1_0003.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 21:32:25","kind":"goal_best","it":0,"steps":16384,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task, keep learning","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.925,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.06,"crashed":0.015,"score":244.4996478216264},"champion":"runs/M1/champions/i00000_s0_goal.json","run":"M1","replay":"replays/M1_0002.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 21:32:22","kind":"run_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"note":"Main run 1. The bake-off winner (PPO from a random 2x128 network, 45 min, 42 M steps, 91.4% on 500 shared analysis flights) continues: same network, same optimiser state. Stage 1 keeps learning on the real task (it was still improving). Stage 2: hard cases, 30% of flights re-fly real-task seeds it failed on recent checks (each check uses fresh seeds, so later checks stay clean). Stage 3: fine-tune with a lower learning rate and less exploration.","run":"M1"},{"t":"2026-10-30 21:32:22","kind":"stage_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task, keep learning","expect":"The check average was still rising (90.8% at 26 M steps -> 93.8% at 39 M). Expect ~95% within 2 hours, boulder hits falling from ~5% to ~3%.","run":"M1"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:45:09","kind":"time_limit","it":2760,"steps":45219840,"stage_index":0,"minutes":45.0,"run":"bake_B_ppo_warm"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:44:35","kind":"goal_best","it":2720,"steps":44580864,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.945,"offpad":0.02,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.015,"crashed":0.02,"score":253.5454806707197},"champion":"runs/bake_B_ppo_warm/champions/i02720_s0_goal.json","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm","replay":"replays/bake_B_ppo_warm_0005.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:14:25","title":"Bake-off, halfway: PPO from scratch is far ahead","text":"Candidate A (PPO from a random 2x128 network, real task only) ran 45 minutes, 42 M steps. On its 200-flight real-task checks it reached 93-97% landed in the last minutes (off-pad 0%, timeouts 0-1%; almost all remaining failures are boulder hits, 2.5-6%). That is already well above every earlier agent (85%). Candidate B (PPO warm-started from the 83.5% clone) sits at 80-84% after 13 M steps: its low entropy (0.11) means it barely explores and stays close to the clone. Candidate C (evolution strategy) runs next. The single checks are best-of-many and flatter; the fair comparison is the 500 shared analysis flights at the end.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:01:18","kind":"goal_best","it":70,"steps":1163264,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.915,"offpad":0.03,"timeout":0.01,"boulder":0.025,"crashed":0.02,"score":202.36492202625774},"champion":"runs/bake_B_ppo_warm/champions/i00070_s0_goal.json","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm","replay":"replays/bake_B_ppo_warm_0004.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:00:36","kind":"goal_best","it":30,"steps":507904,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.86,"offpad":0.055,"timeout":0.005,"boulder":0.035,"crashed":0.045,"score":187.5335755728455},"champion":"runs/bake_B_ppo_warm/champions/i00030_s0_goal.json","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm","replay":"replays/bake_B_ppo_warm_0003.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:00:25","kind":"goal_best","it":20,"steps":344064,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.845,"offpad":0.075,"timeout":0.01,"boulder":0.02,"crashed":0.05,"score":185.9809881889388},"champion":"runs/bake_B_ppo_warm/champions/i00020_s0_goal.json","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm","replay":"replays/bake_B_ppo_warm_0002.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:00:09","kind":"run_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"note":"Bake-off candidate B: PPO warm-started from the behaviour clone of pilot v2 (2x128, 83.5%), critic trained alone for 15 iterations first on the real task only. Reward: game score + 200 for resting between the flags, -100 off-pad rest, -100 timeout.","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:00:09","kind":"stage_start","it":0,"steps":0,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","expect":"Starts at ~84% and climbs, as gradients use every step of experience. Risk: the first updates damage the clone.","run":"bake_B_ppo_warm"},{"t":"2026-10-30 20:00:05","kind":"time_limit","it":2567,"steps":42074112,"stage_index":0,"minutes":45.0,"run":"bake_A_ppo_scratch"},{"t":"2026-10-30 19:50:40","kind":"goal_best","it":1950,"steps":31981568,"stage_index":0,"stage":"real task","check":{"n":200,"landed":0.975,"offpad":0.0,"timeout":0.0,"boulder":0.02,"crashed":0.005,"score":253.70312824441086},"champion":"runs/bake_A_ppo_scratch/champions/i01950_s0_goal.json","run":"bake_A_ppo_scratch","replay":"replays/bake_A_ppo_scratch_0030.gif"},{"t":"2026-10-30 19:45:14","k